/*
!.gitignore
!snmp-telemetry/
!sqlserver-telemetry/
!azure-aks-operator-telemetry/
!openclaw-telemetry/
openclaw-telemetry/.harness/
!claude-code-telemetry/
claude-code-telemetry/.harness/
!codex-telemetry/
codex-telemetry/.harness/
# _shared subtree: only the new azure/components tree is tracked. The rest
# of _shared (cloud-infra, gcp, azure scraper, etc.) remains untracked
# local-only work.
!_shared/
_shared/*
!_shared/azure/
_shared/azure/*
!_shared/azure/components/
